      "x": 524,
      "y": 636,
      "width": 404,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "The question\nShould Harbor Street Coffee open at 41 Mill Lane?\n\nStill open: the summer dip, and whether the landlord confirms the rent-free months in writing.",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "draft",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 952,
      "y": 636,
      "width": 404,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "Draft answer\nOpen, if the rent-free period is confirmed. The fit-out is paid back in month 14 at the projected 190 orders per day.\n\nReplace this with your own view.",
      "color": "4"
    }
